# Bun auto-loads .env.test (this file) OVER .env whenever NODE_ENV=test,
# which `bun test` sets automatically. apps/store/.env carries a real
# ZEROENTROPY_API_KEY for local dev — without this override, `bun test`
# would inherit that real key, and search() now calls the vendored
# engine's hybridSearch(), which embeds (and can rerank) the query itself
# through the gateway rather than through the fakeEmbed function this
# suite injects for writes. Tests must never make a real paid provider
# call. Blanking the key here makes the gateway's own isAvailable()
# checks fail closed automatically, no matter what test file runs or
# what it constructs EngineStore with.
ZEROENTROPY_API_KEY=
